{"id":"oxfi3l83a3089aoylaunjl8a8","title":"平安西安高科产业园REIT在深交所上市","originalTitle":null,"summary":"平安西安高科产业园封闭式基础设施证券投资基金（代码180107）于2026年11月12日在深交所上市，首发份额4亿份，募资11.656亿元。底层资产为西安高新区3TCOM云汇谷产业社区，已运营8年，入驻企业包括阿里巴巴、科大讯飞等13栋楼宇32.5万平方米的软件产业集群。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"界面新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15325259.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T05:43:17.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T06:10:15.915Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T06:10:15.915Z","category":"stock-cn","tags":["产品上线"],"score":55,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"jianli@jiemian.com(界面陕西)","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}